# Lucky页面重定向规则
# 将旧的独立HTML文件重定向到统一的lucky.html页面

RewriteEngine On

# Lucky1-11重定向到新的统一页面系统
RewriteRule ^lucky1\.html$ lucky.html?id=1 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky2\.html$ lucky.html?id=2 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky3\.html$ lucky.html?id=3 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky4\.html$ lucky.html?id=1018 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky5\.html$ lucky.html?id=1019 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky6\.html$ lucky.html?id=1020 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky7\.html$ lucky.html?id=1021 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky8\.html$ lucky.html?id=1022 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky9\.html$ lucky.html?id=1023 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky10\.html$ lucky.html?id=1024 [R=301,L,QSA]
RewriteRule ^lucky11\.html$ lucky.html?id=1025 [R=301,L,QSA]

# QSA标志：保留原始查询参数
# R=301：永久重定向
# L：最后一条规则，匹配后停止处理
